{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bb975b524abf22c1e25f6462a060b40065d48b17896da3e21fadf94e9c217554", "ja": "（あずささんが持つ、大人の魅力を\n引き立たせる衣装が完成した。本人も満足気だ！）", "zh": "（能衬托出应梓小姐成熟魅力的服装完成了。本人看起来也很满意！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "5aac52437425f11318a2fb6d6b4d320eaaf8f0f0c06c40e1f567644163188bd3", "ja": "うふふ。とっても素敵な衣装で、\n今からステージに立つのが楽しみです～。", "zh": "呵呵。这套服装真的很棒，我已经开始期待登上舞台了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "50736191b26af3717797f5acd80c72af14b1af86eaca1795f93350acbfa6362d", "ja": "あ、でも……ファンのみなさんは、どう思うかしら。\n私にしては、ちょっと珍しいテイストですし……。", "zh": "啊，不过……不知道粉丝们会怎么想呢。\n对我来说，这可是相当少见的风格……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1003_p", "source_sha256": "41d0b3c4b1f8d7d5bf73f29a998329484a6158a4ac8f0fb70d5b54560ca0bb7f", "ja": "反応、気になりますか？", "zh": "你很在意大家的反应吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "939c445d8eccbfb740929773fa43bbfb6a12647cfe8a2c37796adda2ce08d612", "ja": "はい……。この衣装のデザインを初めて見た時、\n私、すごくドキドキしたんです。", "zh": "是的……第一次看到这套服装的设计时，\n我的心跳得特别快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "8ed3c090b0537fa7c6edfcaa8ed22ecbf2d80e71f6e3c20e140879f97de4f95e", "ja": "だからみなさんにも、そんな素敵なドキドキを、\n感じてもらえたらいいなって思うんですけど。", "zh": "所以，我也希望大家能感受到那份美好的心动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b565a7a2906a31120942d23feb10c01358be22811685e5340fa7c4802a4cd285", "ja": "心配いりませんよ。あずささんの今の姿を見たら、\nみんなドキドキしてくれると思います。", "zh": "不用担心。只要看到梓小姐现在的样子，\n大家肯定都会心动的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "a02c1a9d49fc10883b5846339628a48549109fc8f23c260bdec3b79ce451ce49", "ja": "本当ですか？　自分では、衣装の魅力をしっかり\n伝えられてるかどうか、不安があって……。", "zh": "真的吗？我有点担心，自己是否充分展现出了这套服装的魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e7a33fe2681b26f54fb7dd00893bff2aff7dc51112ace744d2ea912ccb90f38d", "ja": "大丈夫です！　デザインを既に知っていた俺が、\n今のあずささんを見て、ドキドキしてますから。", "zh": "没问题的！明明我早就知道设计是什么样了，\n看到现在的梓小姐，却还是会心跳加速呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "d76b3c6fc2bd6513a75baacf4cc5884823ef2d9cba960caaf8931eee394568b5", "ja": "まあ……♪　うふふ、それなら安心ですね。\nもちろん、魅せる努力は続けないといけませんけど。", "zh": "不过……♪　呵呵，那我就放心了。\n当然，展现魅力的努力也不能停止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1010_p", "source_sha256": "92d70bd6c36f631616194b4281cf9963eb8cb7ffb04cdc1814aa43f04d281e9a", "ja": "そうですね。今もよく似合いますけど……\nステージに立ったら、もっと輝くと思います。", "zh": "是啊。现在也很适合您，不过……站上舞台后，我觉得您会更加闪耀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "2c4f8eba61ce4d5fad46f7e7f129aedea92875f35703b78cd4a69ea5881444d3", "ja": "はい、がんばります。私の成長をお見せする、\nいい機会にもなると思いますし。", "zh": "好的，我会努力的。我也觉得这会是一个展现自己成长的好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "aa62da1c203a599d2c577d673ce4f52bdaa7ba323282e8323de02fcaeec591f8", "ja": "たとえば、この衣装を活かして演じるなら……\n落ち着きがあって、クールな大人って感じでしょうか？", "zh": "比如，要发挥这套服装的特点来表演的话……\n应该会是那种沉着冷静、很有大人风范的感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1013_p", "source_sha256": "30fb100a34caa47dd77b748b4dacc35a2fa4f45e587b70d6dc7f14cfc053c7ec", "ja": "いいですね！　イメージの幅が広がって、\nファンの人たちの期待も膨らむと思います。", "zh": "很不错呢！不仅能拓宽展现的形象，\n粉丝们的期待想必也会更加高涨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "f2d97c2cabca8a9305f85b0e66125472798e32545e56df80eabccaa8a9658561", "ja": "……。みなさんの期待を裏切らないように、\nもっと頑張らなくちゃいけませんね♪", "zh": "……为了不辜负大家的期待，还得更加努力才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "40decb7498a668590600cc525765396084a27d5f70173ed83ab5f2ad553ab187", "ja": "それから……\n{$P$}さんの期待にも！", "zh": "还有……\n也不能辜负{$P$}先生的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "2128576ea13c62d7ce7019d6b0a568fee69fbd02713ba7b08f1ad77e7df58b9d", "ja": "日頃お世話になっている分、私もアイドルとして\nまだまだ成長できるってこと、お見せしますね。", "zh": "为了回报平日里受到的照顾，我也会让您看看，作为偶像的我还能够继续成长哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0cec56368b232688bc30d754d0fa4423f8d8fa68b2b6af7e0d320771501df229", "ja": "……頼もしいです。\n楽しみにさせてもらいます！", "zh": "……真可靠。\n我很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "a9c085d65b67a1d7c9e07faed06111ee964ad26b354e9b9a039442226b23e540", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n待っててくださいね、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n请等着我哦，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0464_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "a92d5049833e675f07af088313d0d6bf0cc5aa64f26f50a481befd64a5711684", "ja": "……今よりもっと、ドキドキさせてあげる。", "zh": "……我会让你比现在更加心动哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
